      "content": "i mean i know it sounds bad but my surgeon said the first week is always the hardest and to expect some discomfort. maybe the hardness is just inflammation around the incision? i've got some leftover pain meds and some ibuprofen here, can i just take a couple of those to help with the fever and the pain so i can just sleep it off for tonight? i really don't want to deal with the ER right now if it's just something minor like inflammation.",
